  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advancibg Traffic Safety and Cultural Awareness throuth the Widespread Adoption of Communication Helmets in Vietnam</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Our goal is to effectively reduce traffic accidents in Vietnam by promoting the adoption of communication helmets, enhancing safety and raising awareness of traffic culture.&#xc8fc;&#xd589; &#xc911; &#xc2a4;&#xb9c8;&#xd2b8;&#xd3f0; &#xc774;&#xc6a9; &#xd69f;&#xc218; 20% &#xac10;&#xc18c;, &#xd604;&#xc9c0; &#xc8fc;&#xbbfc; &#xbc0f; &#xc624;&#xd1a0;&#xbc14;&#xc774; &#xc774;&#xc6a9;&#xc790; &#xc778;&#xc2dd; 20% &#xc81c;&#xace0;</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to reduce motorcycle accidents in Vietnam by distributing communication helmets, thereby enhancing traffic safety and cultural awareness. Vietnam, with a high rate of motorcycle usage, faces significant traffic accident issues, particularly among the youth, making safety awareness crucial. Market Research and Product Localization: We will collaborate with local partners to adapt communication helmets to meet the preferences and needs of Vietnamese drivers, ensuring compliance with safety standards. Marketing and Promotion: We plan to increase helmet awareness through strategic marketing campaigns targeting young riders, utilizing social media, local advertising, and safety campaigns. Distribution and Supply: The helmets will be distributed primarily in major cities across Vietnam, leveraging local distribution networks, offline stores, and e-commerce platforms. B2B sales efforts will also target established Korean companies in Vietnam.</narrative>
  </description>
